        Dubliners <a href={withBase('/whats-on/')}>What’s On</a> already lists Sunday 8 November in Madrid time.
        Late NFL from <strong>22:05</strong> then <strong>22:25</strong> is the named clock on that board right now.
        Atlético vs Barcelona <strong>21:00</strong> already sat alongside; it does not replace this window.
