        <dd>No. Those pages are sit-through after 21:00, 15:30-then-night, which 19:00 screen, and 12:00-to-late. This is the late NFL window on now.</dd>
        <dt><strong>Does 22:05 / 22:25 replace Atleti or Premier?</strong></dt>
        <dd>No. Coordinate. Those clocks sit alongside on Dubliners What’s On. We do not copy that board onto sister doors.</dd>
      </dl>

